AMENDMENT NO. 110 CONTRACT NO. 5939
LEASE FOR PLACEMENT OF BILLBOARDS ON THE BELVOIR RANCH
This agreement amends Contract No. 5939, dated December 12, 2012, between the City of
Cheyenne and the Lamar Companies by extending the lease in accordance with Section Eleven,
Renewal Option, of the original contract.
1.
Term of Lease.
A.
The lease shall be for a term commencing on February 26, 2018 and expiring on
February 25, 2023.
B.
Upon written request by the Lessee, Lessor may extend the lease for one additional
five-year term. The request shall be submitted by the written notice to the Lessor at
least 120 days prior to the scheduled expiration of the lease. Any extension shall be
on the same terms and conditions as set forth in the original lease or as
renegotiated by mutual written agreement. Any agreement by the Lessor to so
extend shall be conditioned upon Lessee not being in default at the time of giving
such notice or at the commencement of the extended term and that the Lessee has
practiced good stewardship of the property as determined by the Lessor.
2.
Rental.
The annual rental for this lease shall be in the amount of One Thousand Seven Hundred
Dollars ($1,700.00) paid annually within 30 days after the initial commencement date
and annually thereafter.
No other provisions of Contract No. 5939 are amended and all other provisions remain
in full force and effect.
